<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>中国内阁在罕见的午间声明中强调市场支持</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release</link><description>中国国务院在罕见的午间会议上重申了对资本市场的支持，强调了所谓国家队的作用，并承诺推出更多稳定股市的政策。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release'&gt;中国内阁在罕见的午间声明中强调市场支持&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China Stocks Rally After Rare Midday Statement on Market Support&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:00:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>越南希望签署美国贸易协议以限制关税打击</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/vietnam-expects-to-sign-us-trade-deal-to-limit-tariff-hit</link><description>越南预计将与美国签署一项贸易协议，随着两国逐渐接近达成互惠贸易协议，最终关税税率将大幅降低。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/vietnam-expects-to-sign-us-trade-deal-to-limit-tariff-hit'&gt;越南希望签署美国贸易协议以限制关税打击&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Vietnam Expects to Sign US Trade Deal to Limit Tariff Hit&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/vietnam-expects-to-sign-us-trade-deal-to-limit-tariff-hit</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:44:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>富时 100 指数直播：英国股市有望加入全球股市反弹行列</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/live-blog/2026-11-27/ftse-100-live-updates-pound-gilts-ai-stocks-treasuries-hsbc-copper-euro-what-s-moving-uk-markets-right-now-markets-today-mwymmeef</link><description>&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/live-blog/2026-11-27/ftse-100-live-updates-pound-gilts-ai-stocks-treasuries-hsbc-copper-euro-what-s-moving-uk-markets-right-now-markets-today-mwymmeef'&gt;富时 100 指数直播：英国股市有望加入全球股市反弹行列&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：FTSE 100 Live: UK Stocks Poised Join Global Stock Rebound&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/live-blog/2026-11-27/ftse-100-live-updates-pound-gilts-ai-stocks-treasuries-hsbc-copper-euro-what-s-moving-uk-markets-right-now-markets-today-mwymmeef</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:54:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Extend Recovery on AI Trade, Treasuries Dip: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>印度尼西亚逮捕了三名涉嫌参与 MSCI 审查的股票交易的人</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/indonesia-arrests-three-over-trades-in-stock-scrutinized-by-msci</link><description>印度尼西亚警方周五表示，他们因涉嫌操纵 PT Dian Swastatika Sentosa 股票而逮捕了三人，该公司是上个月 MSCI 公司提议分两步下调印度尼西亚市场地位后宣布受到监管制裁的三家公司之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/indonesia-arrests-three-over-trades-in-stock-scrutinized-by-msci'&gt;印度尼西亚逮捕了三名涉嫌参与 MSCI 审查的股票交易的人&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Indonesia Arrests Three Over Trades in Stock Scrutinized by MSCI&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/indonesia-arrests-three-over-trades-in-stock-scrutinized-by-msci</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:59:35 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>